WEBVTT

1
00:00:37.607 --> 00:00:39.148
How do you say "grilled cheese"?

2
00:00:52.027 --> 00:00:53.311
-Hello.
-<i>Hi.</i>

3
00:00:56.265 --> 00:00:57.694
<i>I'm on my way from the airport,</i>

4
00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:00.043
<i>and the front desk won't
get me your room number.</i>

5
00:01:02.656 --> 00:01:03.965
<i>What's your room number?</i>

6
00:01:07.324 --> 00:01:09.556
-403.
-<i>See you in half an hour.</i>

7
00:01:09.686 --> 00:01:11.817
-Wait a second.
-<i>What?</i>

8
00:01:12.006 --> 00:01:14.003
-Where are you?
-<i>I'm here.</i>

9
00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.578
I didn't say you could come here.

10
00:01:18.549 --> 00:01:19.917
<i>Can I come there?</i>

11
00:01:23.839 --> 00:01:24.623
OK.

12
00:01:24.753 --> 00:01:26.301
<i>I'll see you in half an hour.</i>

13
00:03:19.068 --> 00:03:20.766
What's this music?

14
00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.772
How did you find me?

15
00:03:49.508 --> 00:03:51.204
It wasn't actually that hard.

16
00:04:49.677 --> 00:04:51.329
Are you going to take a bath?

17
00:04:52.367 --> 00:04:53.408
It's for you.

18
00:04:57.907 --> 00:04:59.118
What got you here?

19
00:05:01.508 --> 00:05:02.672
Bar in the lobby.

20
00:05:20.542 --> 00:05:22.084
What the fuck is going on?

21
00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:35.676
How long have you been
at this hotel now?

22
00:05:37.237 --> 00:05:38.221
I don't know.

23
00:05:39.643 --> 00:05:40.791
More than a week?

24
00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:43.476
More than a week.

25
00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:46.425
More than a month?

26
00:05:48.077 --> 00:05:49.288
More than a month.

27
00:05:51.018 --> 00:05:52.402
How much does it cost?

28
00:05:54.246 --> 00:05:58.157
I think around
750 million euros or something.

29
00:06:01.872 --> 00:06:03.579
How long are you gonna stay?

30
00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:06.707
How long do you wanna stay?

31
00:06:08.641 --> 00:06:10.260
I'm leaving tomorrow morning.

32
00:06:31.787 --> 00:06:33.769
I think it's time for you to go home.

33
00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:37.323
Probably.

34
00:06:39.152 --> 00:06:40.819
Are you running away from me?

35
00:06:43.272 --> 00:06:44.735
I thought I already did.

36
00:07:30.374 --> 00:07:32.554
Would you order me
a Bloody Mary, please?

37
00:07:33.424 --> 00:07:35.448
Two Bloody Maries, please.

38
00:08:38.145 --> 00:08:39.670
Have you slept with anyone?

39
00:08:42.576 --> 00:08:43.347
No.

40
00:08:44.151 --> 00:08:44.991
Have you?

41
00:08:49.185 --> 00:08:49.956
No.

42
00:08:51.073 --> 00:08:52.661
That was a long pause.

43
00:09:01.402 --> 00:09:03.888
-I guess it doesn't really matter.
-No, it doesn't.

44
00:09:11.503 --> 00:09:13.296
You got bruises on your body.

45
00:09:24.744 --> 00:09:28.100
Whatever happens in the end,
I don't wanna lose you as my friend.

46
00:09:30.403 --> 00:09:31.472
I promise...

47
00:09:31.915 --> 00:09:33.529
I will never be your friend...

48
00:09:33.891 --> 00:09:34.998
no matter what.

49
00:09:35.337 --> 00:09:36.092
Ever.

50
00:09:42.068 --> 00:09:44.634
We fuck, then I'll feel
like shit tomorrow.

51
00:09:47.352 --> 00:09:48.579
That's OK with me.

52
00:10:07.562 --> 00:10:08.521
I love you.

53
00:10:10.236 --> 00:10:11.981
I never hurt you on purpose.

54
00:10:14.458 --> 00:10:15.465
I don't care.

55
00:10:34.133 --> 00:10:35.722
Wanna see my view of Paris?

56
00:10:37.468 --> 00:10:38.223
OK.
